    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SYDNEY: She's been pumped full of sedative, she's barely lucid. You're not gonna get much --\nMADISON: It's okay, Sydney.\nMADISON: I don't know how much help I'll be. But I'll answer whatever I can...",
      "SYDNEY: Hey. Got you some groceries. Thought I'll make you your fav dish tonight, what'd say??\nSYDNEY: Umm. What the hell was that?\nMADISON: Nothing.",
      "SYDNEY: Madison??\nMADISON. OPEN THE DOOR: Sydney shoulders the door -- again and again -- finally smashing it open and seeing an empty bed.",
      "REGINA: It's gonna take awhile.\nSYDNEY: We'll wait.\nSYDNEY: If there's nothing there, then we're lying, lock us up.\nSYDNEY: If there is, you have a serial killer on your hands, Detective.",
      "SYDNEY: Sorry...\nSYDNEY: ...don't mean to play with your bird.\nREGINA: A red neon \"Silvercup\" sign is an apartment building down in Boyle Heights.\nMADISON: That's it. It's across from it."
    ]
